# Circuit artifacts are built, not committed.
#
# payment.zkey is already ignored repository-wide; payment.wasm is 5 MB of
# generated output that git would carry forever for no benefit. Both are
# reproducible from the circuit in seconds — see ../README.md.
*.wasm
*.zkey
*.r1cs
*.sym
*.json

# Keep the directory itself so PROVER_ARTIFACTS_DIR has somewhere to default to.
!.gitignore
